## Lovelace plugins

Installed through Home Assistant's built-in **Marketplace** (not HACS) into `www/community/` and registered in `.storage/lovelace_resources`.

| Name | Description |
| --- | --- |
| [floor3d-card](https://github.com/giosci1994/floor3d-card) | Shows entity states on a 3D model |
| [ha-homelab-map](https://github.com/kjanas/ha-homelab-map) | Hand-placed live map of the homelab |

`/local/floor3d/weather.js` is also registered as a resource. `frontend.extra_module_url` in `configuration.yaml` (formerly `card-mod`) is commented out.

## Themes

Stored under `themes/`, loaded via `frontend.themes` in `configuration.yaml`.

| Name | Notes |
| --- | --- |
| Frosted Glass Auto | follows system light/dark |
| Frosted Glass Dark | dark only |
| Frosted Glass Light | light only |

## Supporting integrations

- **Music Assistant** — wires media player cards
- **alert** — surfaces system alerts directly on the dashboard
